export anchor DarkCommandFirstStyle:
    number: 230
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Dark command first
    idea: A sparse dark home centred on one large command field with keyboard hints, where the urgent items appear as palette rows under it and the rest of the dashboard sits quietly below in small monospace-labelled lists.
    base: dark
    palette:
        void: #0d0e10, the page and the style sheet
        palette: #16181c, the command panel, fields and hover rows
        key: #1f2328, key caps, the current nav item and the secondary button
        line: #2b2f36, panel edges, group dividers, rules and meter tracks
        ink: #ececee, text
        muted: #9ca1aa, labels, hints, meta and times
        teal: #5fd4c4, the selected row edge, meters, this week bars, the primary button and focus
        onTeal: #062a25, text on teal
        tealWash: #13302c, the selected palette row
        lastWeek: #6f7580, last week bars
        ok: #7ddc9a, the On track word and icon
        risk: #f2c66d, the At risk word and icon
        bad: #ff9585, the Behind word and icon and the overdue row
    type:
        Body in system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto. Labels, figures, keys and times
        in ui-monospace, SF Mono, Cascadia Code, Menlo, Consolas. The
        command input is 18px, the greeting line 15px, rows 14px, figures
        24px mono at 600, group labels 11px mono caps at 600 tracked 0.08em,
        key caps 11.5px mono.
    layout:
        A borderless top line holds the lowercase mono wordmark in teal, six
        small text links with Home on a key tile, then a square bell and an
        MO tile with Mara Okafor. The first screen is mostly empty. Centred
        at 720px sit the line Good morning, Mara · Saturday 31 October 2026
        and then the command panel with a deep shadow. Its field reads
        Search projects and tasks, or type a command with a Ctrl K key. Under
        the field a Needs you group lists 4 tasks are overdue as the selected
        row with a teal edge and an Enter key, then Billing migration with
        Behind and Mobile app 2.0 with At risk. An Actions group holds the
        New project button as a palette row with an N key. A row of hints
        follows with keys for move, open, new project, 1 to 6 to jump and
        search. Far below, the four figures sit in one mono strip ruled
        above and below. Then two columns. Projects is a compact numbered
        list from 1 to 6 with name, category, due, tasks, a teal meter and
        the status. The right column holds a small Completed per day chart
        with the totals in mono and an Activity list with mono times on the
        left. Below 700px the nav takes its own row, only two hints show,
        the figures go two by two and lists stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 72px of air above and below the command panel, 8 to 10px palette row padding.
    density: Sparse at the top, compact below. One field owns the first screen.
    corners: 14px command panel, 8px rows and buttons, 5px key caps.
    borders: 1px #2b2f36 on the panel and dividers. Key caps have a 2px bottom edge.
    shadows: One deep shadow, 0 20px 60px black at 55 percent, under the command panel only.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.75 stroke, 16px, and 20px in the field. Status is a
        check circle, a triangle or a crossed square with the word in mono.
    focus: A 2px teal outline offset 2px, and a 2px inset teal ring on the command field.
    tone: Imperative and keyboard-led, such as Needs you, Actions, move, open and 1 to 6 to jump.
